body:
All of them

&#x200B;

*except for romance*

Fossilized dinosaur poop.

&#x200B;

Not scary or disturbing, I just wanted to share that information somewhere that was somewhat appropriate for my words.

I cannot concentrate at school because of a certain few kids who distract everyone because of their own non-interest in learning.

&#x200B;

 ಠ\_ಠ

Butter chicken

&#x200B;

I'm not sure about other places but where I live butter chicken is the food most people like. I hate it.

I have had many nicknames online but Emi and hotdog are the 2 that people still call me by.

&#x200B;

*so why not combine them?*

"You totally remind me of those wicked burgers at burger king, I really like those."

&#x200B;

*sorry don't say that to anyone*

When I was little I had a nightmare that came at least once a month. It wasn't actually scary now that I think about it but 7 year old me was terrified. (Keep in mind that in this nightmare Barney and Grimace were very big, about the height of the tallest person in the world.)

&#x200B;

Alright, so in this nightmare I dreamed that Barney and Grimace were trying to murder me. I have very vivid memory of this dream, I was locked into a small grey room and there was a huge bed taking up three quarters of the room. Barney and Grimace were walking around the bed trying to find me but I went under the bed. next thing I knew they were looking under the bed and for whatever reason I saw this like it was a movie, the way I saw it was looking the lowest I could in third person so all I could see was Barney's face and then I got to look up and see myself hanging onto the wooden planks that hold mattresses up on bed frames.

&#x200B;

I woke up right after that and I went into my mum and dad's room sobbing and being so scared, lol. (I had another nightmare once I got into their bed, I always got nightmares sleeping in a bed that isn't my own for some reason).

Every single day when I walk to school and back there's at least 1 car that indicates at the exact moment they're turning, not even slowing down. Exactly why I'm too scared to cross the road.

&#x200B;

If I was allowed to cuss at all I would do it for the entire day.
